{
  "schema": "daemonv12.signature-rack.score/1",
  "title": "THE LANDING REMEMBERS",
  "description": "ENM STUDIO / INFINITE STAIRWELL. A rising fifth, a semitone of hesitation, a falling fourth: stone learns to sing. D minor becomes D major in the mouth of one close voice, then the staircase asks again. Original four-bar film loop.",
  "bpm": 96,
  "key": "D minor",
  "timeSignature": "4/4",
  "swing": 0.5,
  "seed": 193018,
  "tailSeconds": 10,
  "masterGainDb": 0,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "stone",
      "bars": 1,
      "development": "D minor/add9. The D-A-Bb-F motif, with an answering voice below the struck bars."
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "bars": 1,
      "development": "Bb major9/#11. The same outline returns; its last note opens into E instead of F."
    },
    {
      "id": "someone",
      "bars": 1,
      "development": "D major9/F#. Metal falls silent. A close human-scale voice changes Bb to B and F to F#. The building remembers warmth."
    },
    {
      "id": "upstairs",
      "bars": 1,
      "development": "A7sus/b9 to A7. G-E-C# descends as the final A pickup reaches back to the opening D. Tails continue around the loop."
    }
  ],
